    <string name="about_title">About the author</string>
    <string name="about_author">Borislav Zahariev (BZ)</string>
    <string name="about_author_line">Author: Borislav Zahariev (BZ)</string>
    <string name="about_body">BZ Music is a simple local music player for Android.\n\nBrowse your device library to pick a file or choose to play everything from the selected folder and sub-folders.\n\nShuffle and Repeat are supported in \"List\" and \"Song Info\" views.\n\nIn List view content can be sorted by Name, Artist and Release Year. Any sorting disables Shuffle.\n\nThis player can also play WMA files (via built-in LibVLC), which stock Android players usually cannot.\n\nOptional internet use:\n- album art, if a track has no embedded cover\n- Release year/date, if the track has no data.\n\nNO COMMERCIALS!</string>
